{"4579030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bluff or Bust", "steam_appid": 4579030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579030/extras/ffeb0603c963e89750d16da45ccc3f7b.avif?t=1784943802\" width=645 height=215 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bluff or Bust</i> is a high-stakes multiplayer game of deception, deduction, and sleight of hand inspired by the Persian folk game <strong>Gol Ya Pooch</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One team hides the goal ball through subtle hand movements and misdirection. The opposing team must study every gesture, replay suspicious actions, gather clues, and uncover the Goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Bluff or Bust, your hands do the talking…<br>But can anyone trust what they're saying?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579030/extras/14ddd7e34dd5f8c476d8622558a4cb90.avif?t=1784943802\" width=645 height=215 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every movement matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique <strong>confidence system</strong> transforms player behavior into gameplay. Nervous mistakes, shaky hand movements, and failed actions can leak clues to your opponents, while confident performances create uncertainty and deception. Use your Bluffs to pressure opponents, manipulate suspicion, and control the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579030/extras/b7dce5c8435bec66bb1f41f66727ac50.avif?t=1784943802\" width=645 height=215 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bluff or Bust is built around observation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study clues to determine whether a player is hiding the Goal… or trying to fool you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round becomes a battle of deduction, intuition, and psychological pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579030/extras/061f532980ae3e6752a797d0010b2b55.avif?t=1784943802\" width=645 height=215 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of students at a melting pot of cultures in a Canadian university, each with their own personality and special ability. Pick your favorite and use their unique skills to bluff smarter, read opponents, and outplay the other team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your strategy around unique strengths as friendships, rivalries, and competitive tension evolve both on and off the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579030/extras/224a011dc9d6cd0a571a02b9f0306aba.avif?t=1784943802\" width=645 height=215 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending folklore with a modern, stylized aesthetic, <i>Bluff or Bust</i> brings the viral Iranian sensation <strong>Gol Ya Pooch</strong> to a global stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather around the table.<br>Read the room.<br>Trust no hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579030/extras/ffeb0603c963e89750d16da45ccc3f7b.avif?t=1784943802\" width=645 height=215 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bluff or Bust</i> is a high-stakes multiplayer game of deception, deduction, and sleight of hand inspired by the Persian folk game <strong>Gol Ya Pooch</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One team hides the goal ball through subtle hand movements and misdirection. The opposing team must study every gesture, replay suspicious actions, gather clues, and uncover the Goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Bluff or Bust, your hands do the talking…<br>But can anyone trust what they're saying?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579030/extras/14ddd7e34dd5f8c476d8622558a4cb90.avif?t=1784943802\" width=645 height=215 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every movement matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique <strong>confidence system</strong> transforms player behavior into gameplay. Nervous mistakes, shaky hand movements, and failed actions can leak clues to your opponents, while confident performances create uncertainty and deception. Use your Bluffs to pressure opponents, manipulate suspicion, and control the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579030/extras/b7dce5c8435bec66bb1f41f66727ac50.avif?t=1784943802\" width=645 height=215 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bluff or Bust is built around observation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study clues to determine whether a player is hiding the Goal… or trying to fool you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round becomes a battle of deduction, intuition, and psychological pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579030/extras/061f532980ae3e6752a797d0010b2b55.avif?t=1784943802\" width=645 height=215 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of students at a melting pot of cultures in a Canadian university, each with their own personality and special ability. Pick your favorite and use their unique skills to bluff smarter, read opponents, and outplay the other team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your strategy around unique strengths as friendships, rivalries, and competitive tension evolve both on and off the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579030/extras/224a011dc9d6cd0a571a02b9f0306aba.avif?t=1784943802\" width=645 height=215 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending folklore with a modern, stylized aesthetic, <i>Bluff or Bust</i> brings the viral Iranian sensation <strong>Gol Ya Pooch</strong> to a global stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather around the table.<br>Read the room.<br>Trust no hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "Bluff or Bust is a multiplayer social deduction game inspired by Persian Gol ya Pooch, where players hide and track a Goal ball using observation, intelligence, and reading body language.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579030/d4d776547068bf73641f6bc2192dc2eb27fa953c/header.jpg?t=1784943802", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579030/8951cb0fda5c24bc04a8b23f2033d368b8546f4e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784943802", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579030/8951cb0fda5c24bc04a8b23f2033d368b8546f4e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784943802", "website": "https://lumino-ent.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GT